    "text": "\u00de\u00e6nne gemiltsa\u00f0 \u00fee, N, mundum qui regit, \u00f0eoda \u00ferymcyningc thronum sedentem a butan ende saule\nGeunne \u00fee on life auctor pacis sibbe ges\u00e6l\u00f0a, salus mundi, metod se m\u00e6ra magna uirtute, and se\nUoca frequenter bide helpes hine, clemens deus, se onsended w\u00e6s summo de throno and \u00fe\u00e6re cl\u00e6nan\nAnd \u00feu \u00fea so\u00f0f\u00e6stan supplex rogo, fultumes bidde friclo uirginem almum, and \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6fter to omnes",
